%% Phase1 / schedule / MV3-G04e 定时消息立即发送
%% 客户端合同真源: /System/Volumes/Data/workspace/angular/visual/cses-client/specs/003-messagev3-gate-inventory/gates/schedule/mv3-g04e/contract.json
%% UI owners: src/pages/message-v3/components/chat-input/chat-input.component.ts（提示条「立即发送」→ 正常 sendMessage 链路 + 清本地定时状态）
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as Angular UI
  participant Gate as MessageV3 Gate Port
  participant Native as Tauri Native
  participant FFI as Flutter FFI
  participant Web as Browser Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant PS as Pending or local state
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM Server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink raw bytes
  Note over UI,Gate: 用户目标：成员点提示条上的「立即发送」，消息马上出现在时间线，提示条消失且不会到点二次发送
  Note over UI,Web: 当前覆盖状态：mock=partial；helix=full；dual=yes；personaLocal=no；该图是交互合同，不把 Mock、HTTP 2xx 或静态注册写成真实 Green
  alt PC Tauri 入口
    UI->>Gate: sendMessage + cancelSchedule(payload)
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_send_message + im_cancel_schedule", payload)
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
  else Flutter FFI 入口
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_send_message + im_cancel_schedule", payload)
  else Browser Web 入口
    Web->>E: invoke("im_send_message + im_cancel_schedule", payload)
  end
  E->>IM: ExecutionShell::step(Tick::Command)
  IM->>IM: 校验 把待发定时消息改为立刻发出 的入参，生成 corr_key/req_id
  IM->>Host: Effect::Http POST /posts/create + POST /posts/cancelSchedule
  Host->>Go: HTTP request with tenant/auth/corr headers
  Go-->>Host: HTTP response（2xx 只代表 admission/query response）
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(http)
  E->>IM: correlate req_id/corr_key
  IM->>Host: Effect::PersistAtomic(projection + cursor)
  Host->>DB: transaction schedule + channel + cursor
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(PersistOk)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(PersistOk)
  E->>IM: release only matching authority corr
  IM->>Host: Effect::Persist ScopedGet(readback)
  Host->>DB: durable readback
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(readback)
  E->>IM: readback is the projection source
  IM->>Sink: Effect::Emit {event,data}（postReceived，POST，channelUpdateByPost，UPDATE_CHANNEL，channelScheduleCanceled）
  Sink-->>UI: Native im:__bus__ raw event → Angular projection
  Sink-->>FFI: FFI batch raw {event,data}
  Sink-->>Web: Web EventBatch raw {event,data}
  alt HTTP / PortReply / Persist error
    IM->>IM: keep prior durable state；attach structured error to corr_key
    IM-->>E: Err or correlated error result
    E-->>Gate: controlled failure
    Gate-->>UI: error / empty state；不得伪造成功事件
  end
  Note over IM,DB: 关键效果：发送成功后发送者侧 channel.unreadCount 绝对归零（== 0，不是递减）；频道内其它可见成员的 getMemberUnread(channelId, otherUserId).unreadCount 相比发送前恰好 +1（幂等累加）；该值必须各侧独立计算，禁止用发送者数值推导；message.readBits 长度 == channel.members.length，位序 == channel.members 顺序，发送者对应位 == '1'；接收者对应位在其调用 postRead 之前恒为 '0'，不得因发送者已读而被置 '1'
  Note over UI,Web: 关键负向：不得留下未取消的定时（否则到点二次发送，同一条消息出现两次）；提示条清理必须按 temporaryId 精确比对，不得凭 channelId 一律清空（会误清另一条待发）；success 到达时命中已有 temporaryId 不得裸替换消息对象，必须 mergePostIntoExisting（否则丢 sendStatus / uploadProgress / 高度缓存）
  Note over E,Sink: 出站事件集合：postReceived，POST，channelUpdateByPost，UPDATE_CHANNEL，channelScheduleCanceled；跨端只搬运 {event,data} 原始字节，不在 shell 复制 reducer
